            "classical_text": "「繫于金柅」、柔道牽也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-6a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 1
        },
        {
          "marker": "九二",
          "classical_text": "包有魚，无咎，不利賓。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-7a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「包有魚」、義不及「賓」也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-8a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 2
        },
        {
          "marker": "九三",
          "classical_text": "臀无膚，其行次且，厲，无大咎。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-9a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「其行次且」、行未牽也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-10a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 3
        },
        {
          "marker": "九四",
          "classical_text": "包无魚，起凶。",
          "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-11a",
          "xiaoxiang": {
            "classical_text": "「无魚」之「凶」、遠民也。",
            "source_page_start": "KR1a0001_tls_044-12a",
            "status": "MAPPED"
          },
          "line": 4
        },
